Source: beacon
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: The FK'ing Projects <beacon@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dpkg-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: beacon
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apt, dpkg, python3 (>= 3.10)
Description: discover software sources and track upstream releases
 Beacon inspects installed Debian packages, explains possible source
 provenance, suggests GitHub upstreams for manual review, and tracks
 confirmed upstream releases. It does not install or update packages.
